            <div class="row detContContent detContContent1179798">
                                <div class="detContIntro">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="offset-md-1 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-12">
                                <p>BBVA will expand its capabilities in Asia after BBVA Japan Securities Limited completed the relevant local regulatory registrations. This new subsidiary serves a strategic purpose: to act as a direct channel connecting Japanese institutional investors with BBVA's global financial solutions, operating strictly as a local sales and middle office platform for the distribution of BBVA's international products.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
